\i Step 5 - Provide a script, command or clearly identified notebook section that can generate predictions for new data.\b0\i0\ulnone \par
\par
\b \i Answer:\b0\i0\ulnone  \i Predictions are generated by the script src/predict.py and run from the project root. It scores the new patients file by default, or any CSV of feature columns passed with --input, and writes the predictions to the file named in config.yaml. If a named person has not recorded a sign-off, the script stops and prints that approval is needed. This is detailed in the README.md file.\b0\i0\ulnone \par
